  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "SunBehaviour is a core controller responsible for simulating celestial mechanics, managing the dynamic day/night cycle within the scene. It controls the position and color of the primary directional light (sun) and optionally a secondary moon light based on internal time progression. It interfaces heavily with SkyboxRenderer to update ambient properties like clear color and fog, ensuring visual consistency across the scene's lighting and skybox elements."
  },
